    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12863" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dēlectāmentum</span></b> ,
		i, n.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				delight</i> (very rare): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pro delectamento,</span>”
				<i>amusement, pastime</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Ter.
					Heaut. 5, 1, 79</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">delectamenta puerorum, etc.,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Pis. 25, 60</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pacis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Nazar. Paneg. Const. 35</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">somni,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg.
					Sap. 7, 2</span></i>
			.</div>
